  "title": "Ants Climbing a Tree (Sichuan Spicy Vermicelli Stir-Fry)",
  "description": "This well known Sichuan dish, also known as \"ants climbing a tree,\" combines ground pork with mung bean vermicelli for a delicious main course.",
  "authors": [
    "Tao,RN"
  ],
